            <div xml:id="d441">

                <pb facs="0532" n="420" sameAs="frus:frus1918/pg420"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 422.11G93/978</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Ecuador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Hartman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Quito</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-09-20T11:00:00-05:14">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">September 20, 1918, 11 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>I am informed that Minister of Finance will not present proposal to Congress for
                    new issue railway bonds, but that Senators and Deputies may consider subject on
                    their own motion.</p>
                <p>I do not believe anything will be done by Congress on that subject and prevalent
                    opinion no legislation affecting the railway will pass.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hartman</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
